1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your headlights look cloudy?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
That's not just looks.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
That yellow haze can cut headlight output

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
by more than half at night.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
It's UV damage to the lens coating —

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
not the bulb. A wipe won't fix it.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
It changes how fast you spot the road...

8
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
...and how fast other drivers spot you.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't drive half-blind.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Send this to someone whose headlights look foggy.
